<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (The improvement occurred because the engineered feature represented the multiplication component of the formula used to calculate `Order_Total`. Therefore, the model successfully reproduced the defined target formula. However, this perfect performance should be interpreted in context: the target was constructed directly from the input features, so the result demonstrates formula reconstruction rather than necessarily demonstrating the ability to predict uncertain real-world order totals.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
